  engineName: Steam Engine
  engineDescription: "A steam engine turbine-generator set is a high-efficiency energy
    conversion machine used in thermal and industrial power plants. High-pressure
    steam enters the turbine and expands through multiple blade stages, transferring
    its thermal energy into rotational motion. The rotating shaft drives an electrical
    generator, producing power while steam pressure and temperature progressively
    decrease before exhausting to the condenser system.\r"
